      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "Use of proceeds We will not receive any proceeds from the sale of ordinary shares held by the Resale Shareholders being registered in this prospectus. Proposed Trading Symbol TRCX Risk factors An investment in our securities involves a high degree of risk. See \u201cRisk Factors\u201d beginning on page 19 of this prospectus and other information included in this prospectus for a discussion of factors you should carefully consider before deciding to invest in our ordinary shares. Alt-1 Table of Contents USE OF PROCEEDS The Resale Shareholders will receive all of the proceeds from any sales of the ordinary shares offered hereby. However, we will incur expenses in connection with the registration of our ordinary shares offered hereby. Alt-2 Table of Contents RESALE SHAREHOLDERS The ordinary shares being offered by American Ventures LLC, Series XX Tracx Logis were issued to it on September 4, 2026 upo",
